<title>UK: Reckitt &amp; Colman sees momentum continuing.</title>
<headline>Reckitt &amp; Colman sees momentum continuing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British household products group Reckitt &amp; Colman said on Wednesday it was confident that the underlying momentum of 1996 would continue.  </p>
<p>The company told shareholders at its annual meeting that the performance of the group remains robust, though it noted that the strength of sterling remained an issue.</p>
<p>&quot;The planned investments for brand development and growth will remain your board's priority,&quot; Reckitt &amp; Colman said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019L</p>
